    skos:definition "The tab row of the About item has the tabs How it works, Words we use, Agents & tools, Mission & backlog, Provenance & known limits, Built-in checks, Your data, and it is the only row of tabs on the page."@en ; dcterms:source "03-materials/ch22/page/sen0414_ch22_page_v9_109_0.html" ;
